{"seq":3,"slug":"business-metric-offline","title":"业务指标的离线代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ranking-offline-eval-platform/offline-metrics/business-metric-offline","wordCount":2913,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"业务指标的离线代理\">业务指标的离线代理</h1><p>业务方看的是转化率、客单价、GMV；离线评测算的是 NDCG。这两组数字之间没有直接的换算关系，而团队在每一次版本评审上都要回答「这个 0.008 的 NDCG 提升值多少钱」。回避这个问题会让评测体系失去组织信任——它会退化成算法团队内部的自我评价工具，业务方无法判断该不该为一次发版承担风险。因此离线评测平台必须具备构造<strong>业务代理指标</strong>的能力：一个可以在离线环境下计算、与真实业务目标强相关、且能解释自己什么时候会失效的量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>业务代理指标的构造有两条路线，它们的信息来源与可靠性特征完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>第一条路线是基于标注的代理</strong>：把标注等级映射为对业务行为的预测，例如把「等级 3」估一个点击概率、把「等级 0」估一个更低的值，再把这些概率按位置和折扣累加成期望转化。它的优点是可在纯离线环境下计算，不需要真实流量；缺点是映射系数是估出来的，估计有误差。</p>\n<p><strong>第二条路线是基于历史日志的代理</strong>：在历史日志上重放新排序，用历史行为（点击、加购、成交）作为奖励信号，通过倾向性加权得到无偏估计。它的优点是直接使用真实行为，缺点是只能评估在历史中<strong>出现过</strong>的商品排列，且对位置偏差敏感——这条路线正是 <a href=\"../offline-online-consistency/position-simulator\">位置偏差模拟与无偏评估</a> 的主题。</p>\n<p>下图给出两条路线与真实业务目标之间的关系。注意两者都不是终点的替代品，而是用来在离线阶段做<strong>排序筛除</strong>的工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[标注等级] --&gt; B[等级-行为映射]&#10;  B --&gt; C[基于标注的代理]&#10;  D[历史日志行为] --&gt; E[倾向性加权重放]&#10;  E --&gt; F[基于日志的代理]&#10;  C --&gt; G{相关性校验}&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt;|历史回验通过| H[进入门禁]&#10;  G --&gt;|不通过| I[修正或弃用]&#10;  H --&gt; J[线上实验确认真实收益]\">graph TD\n  A[标注等级] --&gt; B[等级-行为映射]\n  B --&gt; C[基于标注的代理]\n  D[历史日志行为] --&gt; E[倾向性加权重放]\n  E --&gt; F[基于日志的代理]\n  C --&gt; G{相关性校验}\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt;|历史回验通过| H[进入门禁]\n  G --&gt;|不通过| I[修正或弃用]\n  H --&gt; J[线上实验确认真实收益]</pre><p>关键的纪律是：<strong>代理指标必须经过历史回验</strong>。也就是说，用过去若干次已完成的线上实验作为样本，检验代理指标的离线差值能否预测线上指标的真实差值方向和量级。没有经过这一步的代理指标只是一个凑出来的数字，把它放进门禁会让门禁拦错版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等级-行为映射的估计\">等级-行为映射的估计</h2><p>假设我们采用第一条路线。核心任务是把四级量表映射到一个对业务有意义的量。通常选<strong>期望点击率</strong>或<strong>期望转化率</strong>作为桥梁，因为它们是可观测的中间量，且与最终的 GMV 相关。</p>\n<p>估计方式是：取一段历史日志，对每个被标注的 (查询, 商品) 对，观察它在历史中处于不同位置时的点击率，然后用位置模型把位置效应剥离，得到该商品在该查询下的<strong>内在点击倾向</strong>。再按标注等级分组，取组内均值，就得到每个等级对应的期望点击率。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>clicks</mtext><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mtext>impressions</mtext><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" lspace=\"0.05em\" rspace=\"0.05em\">|</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{click}(r) = \\mathbb{E}\\left[ \\frac{\\text{clicks}_{d,q}}{ \\text{impressions}_{d,q} \\cdot e_{pos(d,q)}} \\;\\middle|\\; r_{d,q} = r \\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5162em;vertical-align:-1.0662em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">impressions</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clicks</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0662em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_{pos}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pos</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span></span></span></span></span> 的查看概率。这个估计有三个需要显式管理的误差源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误差源</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>缓解方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>位置模型不准</td>\n<td>剥离后的点击倾向仍含位置残留</td>\n<td>用随机化实验校准位置模型；分位置分层估计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本稀疏</td>\n<td>高等级商品的样本少，均值不稳</td>\n<td>按品类分层估计，向全局均值收缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混淆</td>\n<td>标注集里的商品不随机，历史行为受旧排序影响</td>\n<td>只用于排序比较，不用于绝对水平预测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三点最重要：标注集里的商品是<strong>旧排序排出来的</strong>，因此它的历史行为天然带有旧排序的印记。这意味着代理指标适合回答「A 版本比 B 版本好多少」这类相对问题，不适合回答「这个版本能带来多少 GMV」这类绝对问题。绝对预测必须留给线上实验，这也是 <a href=\"../offline-online-consistency/offline-online-gap\">离线-在线指标背离原因</a> 里「选择偏差」的一个具体后果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从期望点击到期望业务价值\">从期望点击到期望业务价值</h2><p>有了每个等级的期望点击倾向，还要决定<strong>一次点击值多少钱</strong>。这一步是代理指标与业务目标真正挂钩的地方，也是团队之间分歧最大的地方。</p>\n<p>一个朴素做法是用全局的平均每点击价值（点击到成交的转化率乘以平均客单价）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{proxy}(q) = \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\frac{1}{\\log_2(1+i)} \\cdot \\hat{p}_{click}(r_i) \\cdot \\overline{CR} \\cdot \\overline{AOV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但这个做法忽略了一个关键事实：<strong>点击价值在不同商品间差异极大</strong>。一个 20 元的手机壳和一个 3000 元的手机，单次点击的期望价值差两个数量级。因此更有解释力的做法是<strong>按商品的价格带或类目分组</strong>估计每点击价值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分组维度</th>\n<th>为什么它影响每点击价值</th>\n<th>数据要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品类</td>\n<td>不同品类的转化率与客单价差异大</td>\n<td>品类标注 + 历史成交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格带</td>\n<td>高价商品转化率低但客单价高</td>\n<td>商品价格字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商家类型</td>\n<td>自营与第三方的履约与退货率不同</td>\n<td>商家属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场</td>\n<td>各市场客单价与支付方式不同</td>\n<td>市场标识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分组越细，估计越准，但每个分组的样本越少，估计方差越大。工程上的常见折中是按<strong>品类 × 价格带</strong>二维分组，并对样本不足的格子向品类均值收缩。这套分组口径应当与业务分析团队使用的一致，搜索商业分析拥有这些指标的官方口径与商业解读，本 hub 消费它们而不重新定义。</p>\n<p>值得警惕的是一个常见误区：<strong>把代理指标的绝对值当成收入预测</strong>。代理指标里每个环节都有估计误差（等级映射、位置模型、每点击价值），误差会在求和过程中累积；而它还没有考虑供给约束（排上来的商品可能缺货）、履约约束（跨境物流时效影响转化）与竞争环境。因此代理指标的正确用法是<strong>在门禁里与 NDCG 并列，作为排序方向的一致性或分歧信号</strong>，而不是作为收入数字上报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用历史实验结果回验代理指标\">用历史实验结果回验代理指标</h2><p>回验是代理指标从「一个公式」变成「一个可信工具」的那一步。做法是用过去已经完成的线上实验构造一个校验集，每个样本包含：一个版本的离线代理指标差值、它的 NDCG 差值、以及它在线上实验中的真实业务指标差值（含方向与显著性）。</p>\n<p>然后检查三件事：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验项</th>\n<th>检查方法</th>\n<th>不通过的含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方向一致</td>\n<td>代理差值与线上差值同号的样本占比</td>\n<td>代理指标方向性错误，不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序一致</td>\n<td>按代理差值排序与按线上差值排序的秩相关</td>\n<td>代理能分辨好坏但幅度失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幅度可比</td>\n<td>代理差值与线上差值的线性回归斜率</td>\n<td>可用于预测量级，或只能定性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>方向一致的占比是一个硬门槛：如果代理指标在一半样本上给出与线上相反的方向，说明它捕捉的不是业务价值。理想情况下这个占比应达到 75% 以上，且不一致的样本能被解释（通常是某个特殊品类或某次价格调整导致的）。</p>\n<p>秩相关（如 Spearman）衡量的是代理在<strong>多个候选版本之间</strong>的排序能力，这通常比绝对幅度更重要，因为门禁的职责是「从若干候选里挑出该上的」而不是预测收益数字。幅度回归的斜率如果稳定在某个区间，可以作为粗估使用，但必须注明这是估计而非预测。</p>\n<p>回验还必须检查<strong>失效条件</strong>。代理指标在某些场景下天然不适用，这些场景应当被写成显式规则并在门禁里触发告警而不是静默使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>大促或价格战期间</strong>：历史每点击价值与当期严重不符，代理指标失效。</li>\n<li><strong>新品类上线</strong>：无历史行为数据，等级映射的样本不足。</li>\n<li><strong>供给约束期</strong>：大量商品缺货，商品排序质量与业务收益脱钩。</li>\n<li><strong>市场结构变化</strong>：新市场或新支付方式改变了转化漏斗。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这条纪律与 <a href=\"../regression-baseline/ranking-regression-gate\">排序版本回归门禁</a> 强调的门禁自我监控是同一个原则在不同系统上的体现：任何自动判定机制都必须写明它什么时候不该被信任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代理指标在门禁中的位置\">代理指标在门禁中的位置</h2><p>代理指标进入门禁时应当扮演什么角色，是一个需要明确的设计决策，因为它的可靠性低于 NDCG 这类纯标注驱动的指标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>规则形式</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并列主指标</td>\n<td>NDCG 与代理指标均需不下降</td>\n<td>稳定期，代理回验充分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性检查</td>\n<td>两者方向必须一致，不一致则人工介入</td>\n<td>普遍适用，推荐默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只告警不阻断</td>\n<td>代理指标下降仅发通知</td>\n<td>代理回验尚不充分时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不纳入</td>\n<td>只作为报告项</td>\n<td>大促等已知失效期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐的默认设计是<strong>一致性检查</strong>：NDCG 提升且代理指标不降 → 通过；NDCG 提升但代理指标显著下降 → 不自动通过，转人工评审；NDCG 持平或下降 → 不通过。这样既利用了代理指标提供的额外视角，又不会让一个可靠性中等、且已知会失效的指标拥有否决权——把否决权交给一个在大促期间会给出错误方向的指标，会让门禁在最需要它工作时被绕过。</p>\n<p><a href=\"../regression-baseline/ranking-regression-gate\">排序版本回归门禁</a> 会给出这种多指标联合判定的完整形式与阈值设定方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>业务代理指标是评测体系获得组织信任的必要条件，它让「NDCG 涨了 0.008」可以被翻译成业务语言。</li>\n<li>两条构造路线：基于标注的等级-行为映射（纯离线可算）与基于历史日志的倾向性加权重放（用真实行为但有偏）。</li>\n<li>等级到期望点击的映射必须剥离位置效应，并注意标注集的商品是旧排序排出来的，只适合相对比较。</li>\n<li>从期望点击到业务价值需要按品类与价格带分组估计每点击价值，不能假设全局均一的点击价值。</li>\n<li>代理指标的绝对值不是收入预测；它的正确用法是排序方向的一致性信号。</li>\n<li>代理指标必须用历史实验结果回验方向一致性、排序一致性与幅度可比性，方向一致占比应达 75% 以上。</li>\n<li>必须写明代理指标的失效条件（大促、新品类、供给约束、市场结构变化），并在门禁中触发告警而非静默使用。</li>\n<li>门禁中的推荐角色是一致性检查，而不是拥有否决权的主指标。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[标注等级] --&gt; C[期望点击]&#10;  B[位置模型] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D[每点击价值分组]&#10;  D --&gt; E[代理指标]&#10;  E --&gt; F[历史回验]&#10;  F --&gt; G[门禁一致性检查]\">graph LR\n  A[标注等级] --&gt; C[期望点击]\n  B[位置模型] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D[每点击价值分组]\n  D --&gt; E[代理指标]\n  E --&gt; F[历史回验]\n  F --&gt; G[门禁一致性检查]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"业务指标的离线代理","id":"业务指标的离线代理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"等级-行为映射的估计","id":"等级-行为映射的估计"},{"level":2,"text":"从期望点击到期望业务价值","id":"从期望点击到期望业务价值"},{"level":2,"text":"用历史实验结果回验代理指标","id":"用历史实验结果回验代理指标"},{"level":2,"text":"代理指标在门禁中的位置","id":"代理指标在门禁中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成对/列表指标与位置折扣","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ranking-offline-eval-platform/offline-metrics/pairwise-listwise-metric"},"next":{"title":"离线-在线指标背离原因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ranking-offline-eval-platform/offline-online-consistency/offline-online-gap"}}